{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38577","headline":"过渑池书事 · 吴融","name":"过渑池书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渑池城郭半遗基，无限春愁挂落晖。\n柳渡风轻花浪绿，麦田烟暖锦鸡飞。\n相如忠烈千秋断，二主英雄一梦归。\n莫道新亭人对泣，异乡殊代也沾衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}